cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SINEderella, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SINEderella: genome-wide identification, subfamily assignment and characterisation of SINE retrotransposons"
abstract: "A Bash and Python pipeline: homology search of SINE consensuses against a genome (ssearch36), extraction of copies with flanks, assignment to subfamily consensuses by ten-cycle unanimous voting with a bitscore threshold, post-processing (leak and conflict flags, similarity ratios), satellite and tandem-array screening, length-version and consensus audits, and an HTML report with publish-quality alignments."
authors:
  - name: "Toki-bio"
    website: "https://github.com/Toki-bio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Toki-bio/SINEderella"
url: "https://github.com/Toki-bio/SINEderella"
license-url: "https://github.com/Toki-bio/SINEderella"
version: "2026.10"
date-released: "2026-10-05"
keywords:
  - SINE
  - retrotransposon
  - transposable elements
  - subfamily
  - genome annotation
references:
